                    <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">If a friendly **^^Clattering Procession^^** unit wholly within 12&quot; of this unit was picked to be the target of that spell, this unit can use the &apos;Unbind&apos; ability as if it had **^^Wizard (1)^^**. Add 1 to the unbinding roll for that ability.</characteristic>
